{"type": "message", "id": "6d5fd60c", "parentId": "5c7398be", "timestamp": "2026-04-13T03:16:01.983Z", "message": {"role": "toolResult", "toolCallId": "call_9bcb5f9c4f01452087d0dcfd", "toolName": "web_search", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\n  \"query\": \"rare cancers list cases per year United States sarcoma choriocarcinoma Ewing's cancer statistics\",\n  \"provider\": \"brave\",\n  \"count\": 10,\n  \"tookMs\": 924,\n  \"externalContent\": {\n    \"untrusted\": true,\n    \"source\": \"web_search\",\n    \"provider\": \"brave\",\n    \"wrapped\": true\n  },\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"fdb0b046b2f97ed9\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nEwing Tumor Types Statistics | American Cancer Society | American Cancer Society\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"fdb0b046b2f97ed9\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.cancer.org/cancer/types/ewing-tumor/about/key-statistics.html\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"b7b7152036b16dc5\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n<strong>About 200 children and teens are diagnosed with Ewing tumors (sarcomas) in the United States each year</strong>. Most Ewing tumors occur in teens, but they can also affect younger children, as well as adults (mainly in their 20s and 30s). Slightly more males than females develop these cancers.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"b7b7152036b16dc5\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.cancer.org\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"5cf760fbb25e7a4c\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nKey Statistics for Ewing Sarcoma | American Cancer Society\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"5cf760fbb25e7a4c\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.cancer.org/cancer/types/ewing-tumor/key-statistics.html\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"ca223c752b006257\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nEwing sarcoma is a rare tumor of the tissues that normally make up bone and soft tissue in the body. About 1% of all childhood cancers are Ewing tumors. <strong>About 200 children and teens are diagnosed with Ewing sarcoma in the United States each year</strong>.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"ca223c752b006257\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"January 12, 2026\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.cancer.org\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"2565aefa466ddc8e\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n2022 estimates for sarcomas in the United States\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"2565aefa466ddc8e\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.curesarcoma.org/wp-content/uploads/Sarcoma-Statistics-2022.pdf\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"b867cbfed094f4e2\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n2022 estimates for sarcomas in the United States · Sarcoma accounts for <strong>1% of adult cancers diagnosed in the United States and 15% - 20% of childhood cancers</strong>\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"b867cbfed094f4e2\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.curesarcoma.org\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"328f2dbf6766fbf0\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nKey Statistics for Soft Tissue Sarcomas | American Cancer Society\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"328f2dbf6766fbf0\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.cancer.org/cancer/types/soft-tissue-sarcoma/about/key-statistics.html\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"a82554e1ed4c1029\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nLearn about key statistics for soft tissue sarcomas, including how common they are and who is most affected.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"a82554e1ed4c1029\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"February 9, 2026\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.cancer.org\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"25d1a3ed54b722ed\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nEwing sarcoma: Statistics and more\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"25d1a3ed54b722ed\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.medicalnewstoday.com/articles/how-common-is-ewing-sarcoma\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"3c10be48da440a86\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n... <strong>more than 200 cases of Ewing sarcoma diagnosed in children and teens in the United States each year</strong>. Between 1973 and 2004, the incidence of Ewing sarcoma in the U.S. was ... Ewing sarcoma is a rare form of bone cancer affecting children ...\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"3c10be48da440a86\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"January 12, 2023\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.medicalnewstoday.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"f80d4bae62792313\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nIncidence and Survival in Sarcoma in the United States: A Focus on Musculoskeletal Lesions | Anticancer Research\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"f80d4bae62792313\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://ar.iiarjournals.org/content/33/6/2597\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"d06e6adc7db1765e\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nThe James Comprehensive Cancer Center; The Wexner Medical Center at The Ohio State University, Columbus, OH, U.S.A. ... Background/Aim: The purpose of this study was to analyze the incidence and survival in all sarcomas based on year of diagnosis, anatomical site, grade, stage, and age of patient.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"d06e6adc7db1765e\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"June 1, 2013\",\n      \"siteName\": \"ar.iiarjournals.org\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"e53cda37fe227bec\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nSarcomas in the United States: Recent trends and a call for improved staging - PMC\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"e53cda37fe227bec\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"http